      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name} nothing special needs to happen for it to be made into a wiki page. And it would be ok if it had all the same tags from the docs, but in addition a larger selection of “standardized” tags that came about after some time.\n\nI’m doubting that many more tags will become “common” actually. So I think this shouldn’t be too big of a worry. There won’t be a 100% increase in the number of tags that are considered popular.\n\nNow if anyone just wants an exhaustive list of all tags, that’s a totally different discussion.\n\nVRChat also welcomes additions to all of their documentation. They have multiple routes to suggest fixes and additions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
