      "statusChangeNewStatus": "interested",
      "value": "We're in support of the idea of a dedicated page in the VRChat Wiki as suggested below to include any additional tags, which would allow the community to maintain that list themselves. Once this page exists, we'd consider linking to it directly from the Contact Sender and Contact Receiver components in the SDK as well as from our own Creators documentation, making it clear that the tags built into the SDK are mainly for convenience and are common suggestions only. When deciding what goes into the SDK, we'd probably be aiming for tags that everyone in VRChat might have a reason to use.\n\nIf a community defined tag proves to be popular and generic enough, we could consider adding it to the SDK directly as a suggestion. As with all feature requests for VRChat, we'd likely be accepting future suggestions for built-in tags via Canny - it's unlikely we'll allow the SDK built-in list to be directly edited by users at this time.",
